potentially burdens whomever brings a charge equally with whomever is
charged. 

Say Bokum Snorgwarg brings charges against Fennetcam Bannewarg for being a
pencil-headed drooling geek who doesn't comprehend soap or toothpaste, and
worse yet, does this in print on our exhalted list. Bokum proposes a
