> 

Betsy, you seem to be discounting the many practical postings of folks
like Duncan Frissell, Nick Szabo, Perry Metzger (gone but not
forgotten), Sandy Sandfort, Jamie Dinkelacker, and many others I don't
have space to mention now. These folks, and the 500+ on the
"Cypherpunks" list are more or less involved in actively working to
bring abou the changes that are needed.

I would say that we are indeed "thinking about how to work towards
more freedom" and are working on transition plans. Granted, the
