libertarian and anarchocapitalist goals.  I'm not sure I care
about a more socially advanced way of life: my life is reasonably
close to what I want it to be (to the extent that I can live free
in an unfree world), and others' lives are their own problems.
I agree that discussing singularities, etc. is fun but needs to be
tempered with discussion of the here and now.

